      "content": "<p>A particle is executing simple harmonic motion (SHM). The ratio of potential energy and kinetic energy of the particle when its displacement is half of its amplitude will be</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "1 : 1"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "1 : 4"
